# Sample requests for Chapter 01.
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Postman: import this file as a collection.

@host = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{host}}/

### Create a book
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Designing Data-Intensive Applications",
  "author": "Kleppmann",
  "year": 2017
}

### List books
GET {{host}}/books?limit=10

### List by author
GET {{host}}/books?author=Kleppmann

### Get one book
GET {{host}}/books/1

### 404 example
GET {{host}}/books/9999

### Validation error — year too low (422)
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cave paintings",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "year": 100
}

### Delete (204)
DELETE {{host}}/books/1
